WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:08.717
I feel not in my body.

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:11.094
But I am very present,
if it's possible to be both

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:13.263
not in your body and present
at the same time.

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:15.515
She feels really magical,

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:18.476
which quite
frankly is appropriate because

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:22.022
just having a moment like this,
being here at the Oscars,

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:25.066
that is magical. This
just elevates that magic

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:28.903
to even higher heights,
feels like anything is possible.

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:29.738
And you know what?

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:30.947
I actually believe that.

00:00:30.947 --> 00:00:33.616
If you can become an 
Academy Award winner

00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:35.535
as an openly queer 
Afro-Latina,

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.620
Anything is possible.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.913
If I was talking to my

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:41.166
younger self, I think 
I would just remind her

00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:44.627
that your dreams are not too big
and you are not crazy.

00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:47.213
I don't know. I enjoy proving
people wrong.

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:49.424
So not that that's what 
this moment is.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.260
This is a moment saying 
that your hard work,

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.430
your dedication and
determination, it does pay off.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.848
So you just have to keep going.

